  lines:
  - english: I maintain the traps for the rescue team. Lure monsters onto the orange
      spikes.
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i ph\u1EE5 tr\xE1ch b\u1EABy cho \u0111\u1ED9i c\u1EE9u h\u1ED9.
      H\xE3y d\u1EE5 qu\xE1i l\xEAn b\u1EABy gai m\xE0u cam."
  - english: Correct answers release supplies. Pick them up before moving on.
    vietnamese: "Tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi \u0111\xFAng \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF ti\u1EBFp t\u1EBF.
      Nh\u1EB7t v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m r\u1ED3i h\xE3y \u0111i ti\u1EBFp."
